  "id": "asch-situation",
  "term": "Asch situation",
  "definition": "The Asch situation is a research setting in which a person faces pressure to go along publicly with other participants’ clearly incorrect answers. In this social context, the pull to conform can be experienced as socially threatening and may lead people to respond more cautiously or inhibit their usual behavior.",
